[{"title":"拟七夕宫词 其一","author":"陈克侯","text":"华寝沉沉夜不阑，凤箫吹彻烛花残。\n可怜织女欢无极，谁遣嫦娥闭广寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12487,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟七夕宫词 其二","author":"陈克侯","text":"鹊散萤沉罢晓妆，为谁脉脉懒成章。\n停梭愁绪知多少，不道机丝万缕长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12488,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟七夕宫词 其三","author":"陈克侯","text":"憔悴容华自监宫，不将纨扇怨秋风。\n自怜皎洁招时妒，犹奉君恩箧笥中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12489,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登净乐寺阁","author":"陈克侯","text":"寺枕荒原白日阴，閒阶停骑一登临。\n千艘不断河流急，百雉平连野树深。\n拟向炉烟销世虑，却缘风物助羁吟。\n浮云西北凭栏暮，望断长安思不禁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12490,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将北上次白沙先生韵","author":"李以龙","text":"花满溪头水满陂，林亭深处日华迟。\n秋根自老便高枕，岭树回春正北枝。\n魏阙忽惊沧海梦，柴门终与白云期。\n明良千古凭谁计，尧舜巢由亦此时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12491,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉会楼三首 其一","author":"李以龙","text":"飞阁层空坐榻深，百年拄杖此登临。\n江门秋水来天地，庐阜春云自古今。\n鱼鸟忽惊今日意，江山空忆往年心。\n不堪吟罢更回首，满眼风尘半夕阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12492,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉会楼三首 其二","author":"李以龙","text":"少年曾作江门游，百尺楼高望隔洲。\n一病移时空有梦，十年回首又登楼。\n山光水色凝秋思，野树荒台起暮愁。\n谁剪榛芜开塞路，梅花明月旧矶头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12493,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉会楼三首 其三","author":"李以龙","text":"日出东南万里明，高台遥指白云生。\n漫随古道寻花柳，肯向时人说姓名。\n残碣旧诗犹有迹，沧波烟艇已忘情。\n却怜扰扰浮生梦，欲向先生问八溟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12494,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江浦吟追次林南川韵二首 其一","author":"李以龙","text":"乾坤风月定山佳，诗到江门是一家。\n南海沧波谁钓濑，东吴明月又梅花。\n白云影静千江水，碧玉秋连万树霞。\n两地神交浑梦寐，倚阑吟望几回斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12495,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江浦吟追次林南川韵二首 其二","author":"李以龙","text":"云閒水淡更清佳，万古风流是此家。\n那得春风坐明月，漫寻流水问桃花。\n青牛已去关门路，紫气空残嶂外霞。\n目断闭门长坐处，微茫江上数峰斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12496,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨太后","author":"李以龙","text":"间关为赵忍，社稷与身沉。\n母子当年义，华夷万古心。\n厓门秋雨过，湘水暮云深。\n风落鱼龙夜，依然有鼓琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12497,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆丞相","author":"李以龙","text":"相国丹心破，扶天只手孤。\n行朝犹正笏，大学有吁谟。\n鱼腹星辰冷，龙髯海日枯。\n两厓有奇石，端合为公模。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12498,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文丞相","author":"李以龙","text":"风雨终朝恶，山河万里空。\n有歌遗激烈，无地失英雄。\n不作归来赋，空怀方外踪。\n燕台千载泪，日落海门东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12499,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张太傅","author":"李以龙","text":"鲁连初蹈海，唐帝犹在房。\n中流空有楫，夕浪已无航。\n华夏千篙水，兴亡一瓣香。\n乾坤信翻覆，终古任纲常。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12500,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雷电山萧庄二节妇墓","author":"李以龙","text":"步上大云巅，徘徊盻雷电。\n青草翳寒原，累累二坟见。\n移步抚残碑，浩歌泪如溅。\n吁嗟节义肠，生死那能变。\n彼凶者何人，淫欲肆沉湎。\n残贼灭天性，刚贞逾百炼。\n恶业竟芟荑，芳名流畿甸。\n乾坤茂宰心，纲常为谁振。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12501,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圭峰登高二首 其一","author":"李以龙","text":"扳缘石径上云层，数十年来又一登。\n涧水松风浑落莫，玉台空忆旧时僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12502,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圭峰登高二首 其二","author":"李以龙","text":"重阳抱病起登高，暂倚危阑醉浊醪。\n半夜浮生閒未了，欲随山月卧蓬蒿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12503,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圭峰题李真人岩","author":"李以龙","text":"兰若烟霞访旧踪，岩头秋草礼坛空。\n真人欲觅知何处，犹忆安期望海东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12504,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅夜书怀二首 其一","author":"李以龙","text":"悄悄人初寂，迢迢夜未央。\n秋声惟野树，月影自寒塘。\n归路纡情远，旧游入梦长。\n故园有丛菊，花发似重阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12505,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅夜书怀二首 其二","author":"李以龙","text":"乘月坐江干，幽思转夜阑。\n丹心犹魏阙，清梦祇家山。\n迟暮身多病，萧条路更难。\n归来趺坐处，夜气满松关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12506,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次沙头","author":"李以龙","text":"绕径溪流曲，乘潮舟子轻。\n野花迎槛白，汀竹乱帆青。\n寺杳半空落，村连一带横。\n可怜秋夜月，犹自鼓鼙声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12507,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜不寐","author":"李以龙","text":"暑气晚来收，空斋夜景幽。\n蝉鸣高木叶，船渡远江流。\n月色窗疑曙，风声枕似秋。\n不眠思旧侣，心折此淹留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12508,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳雨坐有怀圭峰登高","author":"李以龙","text":"望望玉台秋可怜，登高心事转悽然。\n黄花牢落东篱晚，细雨霏微九日天。\n杳杳秋空遥度雁，依依海树半浮烟。\n胜游回首今如梦，坐对山灵忆往年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12509,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜","author":"李以龙","text":"时节小寒过，林塘细雨来。\n不眠知夜永，多病惜春回。\n衰骨频欹枕，愁肠不遣杯。\n邻鸡无意绪，钟漏递相催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12510,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吊厓二首 其一","author":"李以龙","text":"澶渊未了百年计，锁钥空教虏使疑。\n和议已成宋故事，出师无复汉威仪。\n云深落月金牌愤，江驻信潮铁锁悲。\n留得乾坤正气在，长风吹雨洗残碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12511,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吊厓二首 其二","author":"李以龙","text":"南北河山入战图，中原戎马失皇都。\n海门日月有千古，晋国衣冠惟五胡。\n渺渺翠华游岛屿，萋萋青冢落蘼芜。\n黍离歌罢还祠庙，拭眼江门看大书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12512,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云岳尊先生升任苍梧诗以言别","author":"李以龙","text":"北风吹雨过苍梧，春色黄云定有无。\n天远离心何处著，江门秋夜月同孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12513,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日居九楼怀仁和梁明府","author":"吴誉闻","text":"春风黄鸟坐相求，倚听声声重客愁。\n削壁飞花聊进酒，乱山疏雨对登楼。\n黔天不到云中雁，湖海难逢雪后舟。\n应笑故人酬世拙，一官寥落自边州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12514,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初入镇郡","author":"吴誉闻","text":"镇郡开黔户，罗施迹尚留。\n山原犹北折，河水自东流。\n猿作殊方语，莺为绝国愁。\n攀崖凌鸟道，沿谷瞰龙湫。\n弥月晴阳少，经时毒雾稠。\n鸡声出晓寨，萤火入边秋。\n仗剑星随马，当歌雪满楼。\n暗蓬惊散地，飞梦杳浮邱。\n白发游堪远，丹心愧未酬。\n艰危身万里，曾不为封侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12515,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登匡山","author":"吴誉闻","text":"灵岳标南纪，澄湖澹北流。\n青莲梵宇豁，白鹿洞门幽。\n瀑趁星河水，风含谷树秋。\n三天虹作驭，双阙玉为楼。\n雁塔云中起，鳌峰象外浮。\n仙踪徒历历，吾道竟悠悠。\n横睨空诸界，幽寻胜十洲。\n几时招五老，重与访丹邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12516,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"待月岭南第一楼","author":"李时春","text":"为访五仙游，同登第一楼。\n捲帘蟾影入，侵袂桂香浮。\n览景抒清啸，高吟对素秋。\n穗羊何处所，应福此阛邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12517,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游七星岩 其一","author":"谭谕","text":"石磴盘旋步上台，浮云浅雨倏然开。\n三天日色临金阙，万叠山光映锦台。\n归洞已看华表鹤，登仙曾折树中梅。\n五千道德从何觅，遥望关门紫气来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12518,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游七星岩 其二","author":"谭谕","text":"嵯峨高洞是蓬莱，袖拂晴岚绝点埃。\n玄石七拳星斗现，青山四面画图开。\n逍遥我亦缑山侣，丹鼎谁知葛令才。\n笑醉碧桃吹凤管，白云天畔倚楼台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12519,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星岩二十景 其一 洞开华盖","author":"谭谕","text":"穹窿一窍与天通，瑞蔼祥光满洞中。\n忽听凤笙声彻处，五云缭绕驾回龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12520,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星岩二十景 其二 黑洞灵潭","author":"谭谕","text":"幽洞灵潭彻底汪，寒泉万丈透羚羊。\n云雷一动潭龙起，宇宙均沾雨泽长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12521,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星岩二十景 其三 沥湖渔棹","author":"谭谕","text":"十里晴湖光接天，一竿渔钓任蹁跹。\n得鱼沽酒维舟晚，醉卧青山绿树边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12522,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星岩二十景 其四 虹桥雪浪","author":"谭谕","text":"星渚虹桥涌雪涛，春雷二月浪花高。\n相逢有客丝纶手，欲向矶头学钓鳌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12523,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星岩二十景 其五 天阁晴岚","author":"谭谕","text":"凌空峻阁傍云开，景色天然画里裁。\n倚槛凭高频纵目，端阳光霁接天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12524,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星岩二十景 其六 树德松涛","author":"谭谕","text":"风入松林万树涛，松头鸣鹤起江皋。\n芳声独有庭槐共，谁羡庾梅与观桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12525,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星岩二十景 其七 蓬壶仙径","author":"谭谕","text":"石径盘旋接汉霄，白云流水隔虹桥。\n缑山跨凤吹笙侣，东去扶桑路不迢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12526,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星岩二十景 其八 地击鼓钟","author":"谭谕","text":"天乐何因向地鸣，果然虚谷自传声。\n华阳更奏宫商调，聊引群仙下洞庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12527,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱明洞怀葛稚川","author":"曾迁","text":"云萝寂寂倚苍苍，古洞犹传不死乡。\n丹灶夜留明月鍊，金泥春带落花香。\n骖鸾月下三山近，化蝶岩前一梦长。\n我亦狂游勾漏令，玄珠何处更求方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12528,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古 其一","author":"李以麟","text":"千金买骏马，万金饰吴钩。\n挂剑上马去，誓为万户侯。\n一登风尘路，永辞珠翠楼。\n谁念香闺人，夜夜徒离忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12529,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古 其二","author":"李以麟","text":"万里萧关道，相望何漫漫。\n目短心苦长，清泪何时乾。\n日落房栊暗，风生衣袂寒。\n留将双鸳绮，愁绝不成看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12530,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古 其三","author":"李以麟","text":"少小谁家女，被服华且鲜。\n清晨扶翠辇，长夜侍华筵。\n朱唇动哀管，繁手弄娇弦。\n有时歌舞散，窈窕百花前。\n东邻有思妇，寂寞竟谁怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12531,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古 其四","author":"李以麟","text":"清夜抱瑶琴，弹向青楼月。\n心乱不成音，哀弦半欲绝。\n更阑玉指寒，曲尽阶苔滑。\n怅然忆远人，愁心不可拨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12532,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古 其五","author":"李以麟","text":"贱妾岂无夫，其奈天一方。\n梦魂飞不到，万感激中肠。\n浴蚕溪水远，拾翠郊原长。\n黄昏深闭阁，暗泪洒衣裳。\n私心在何许，日夕思时康。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12533,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晚","author":"李以麟","text":"晨兴长意佳，独坐开半扉。\n池塘澹不流，轻燕帖水飞。\n青阳醉万物，随地生光辉。\n云飞与川驰，何处不生机。\n安得浴沂者，浩歌以同归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12534,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花下有怀水石邓山人","author":"李以麟","text":"钟鸣山院深，野静烟光阔。\n北风昨夜寒，吹落瑶台雪。\n怀人隔海滨，岁暮音书绝。\n梦破罗浮春，坐惜枝头月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12535,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜经龙兴寺","author":"李以麟","text":"野寺经行处，秋风满客衣。\n僧残空法界，犬吠出岩扉。\n木落寒山静，云深古径微。\n踌躇清梵杳，空带月明归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12536,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中秋夜","author":"李以麟","text":"卧病茅檐下，秋风一夜清。\n离心生雁影，商意入蝉声。\n岁月时将暮，关河露欲凝。\n无情江上月，故故傍人明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12537,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏六首 其一","author":"李以麟","text":"南海沧波远，清时宝剑閒。\n醉残三日雨，兴入万重山。\n天地长留句，风云助笑颜。\n梦回溪上月，犹似照柴关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12538,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏六首 其二","author":"李以麟","text":"几日孤城雨，青山忽又春。\n风花聊此座，云水自閒人。\n开户泉光入，钩帘草色新。\n浮生浑得醉，犹得任吾真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12539,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏六首 其三","author":"李以麟","text":"役役供人事，悠悠见物情。\n百年飞鸟过，万虑野云生。\n时节惊残梦，江山笑短檠。\n古今聊感慨，吾道欲何成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12540,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏六首 其四","author":"李以麟","text":"隐几断来客，幽居事事慵。\n药炉空火候，琴匣半尘封。\n世路何多梗，生涯亦转蓬。\n百年忧国计，时复问年丰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12541,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏六首 其五","author":"李以麟","text":"凉气动疏竹，萧萧一雨过。\n经纶几杯酒，岁月半钓蓑。\n病向閒中积，愁翻醉后多。\n交游总离索，无计问松萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12542,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏六首 其六","author":"李以麟","text":"小雨初晴后，閒居兴倍深。\n浮云开野望，新水净尘襟。\n日落渔樵语，山空鸟雀吟。\n倚阑聊自适，谁识此时心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12543,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙申春同诸社丈北郊会张吴二将军杨武生邀酌松下晚归书事二首 其一","author":"李以麟","text":"柴门日日闭春晴，白发缘愁已乱生。\n闻道郊原新雨足，共寻芳径出山城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12544,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙申春同诸社丈北郊会张吴二将军杨武生邀酌松下晚归书事二首 其二","author":"李以麟","text":"薄暮山前连袂归，浮云漠漠隐斜晖。\n东风十里平芜色，香雾空濛欲湿衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12545,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"定帆亭","author":"李以麟","text":"捲幔东溟阔，抛书晓月寒。\n松风便入梦，谁作怒涛看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12546,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滘头看山同邓吉夫曾明吾梁伯静舟中","author":"李以麟","text":"滘外长风散晚霞，孤舟维向渡头沙。\n海门淡月潮初入，篷底残尊烛半斜。\n路接渔樵闻夜语，岸回霜露带寒花。\n开帘指点看牛女，漫说银河八月槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12547,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游厓山上袁明府萧老师","author":"李以麟","text":"我昔怀厓山，山深不可求。\n鳄湖一以眺，远水空悠悠。\n感此生梦寐，岁华已十周。\n兹行惬夙怀，况得及春游。\n东风吹征衣，新水摇轻舟。\n倏忽两崖间，四顾郁绸缪。\n日落长烟空，宕桨湖中洲。\n怒流激风雨，一夜生寒秋。\n鸡鸣揽衣起，毒雾散平畴。\n乱石如人立，遥天蹴浪浮。\n舍舟沿小港，一径入松楸。\n巍峨新庙宇，寥寂旧山邱。\n景物纷在眼，半带前朝愁。\n弱萝故袅袅，蜚鸟亦啾啾。\n百年夷夏心，凄恻欲谁留。\n回首烟霏外，慷慨席中流。\n赤日腾扶桑，万里阴霾收。\n把酒飏归航，且听渔人讴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12548,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙德歌寿甘泉湛尊师 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"龙之潜，或潜在渊。\n匪江匪汉，瀚渤瀰漫。\n江门之渚，游洋容与。\n江门厓壑，磨龙鳞角。\n江门有云，龙鼾十春。\n于戏，龙寿无垠兮，百千斯年乘元气以逡巡兮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12549,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙德歌寿甘泉湛尊师 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"龙之起，德施斯普。\n日照其鳞，云曳其尾。\n下水上腾，和风甘雨。\n桑杨在山，菁莪在沚。\n发育化生，三千桃李。\n北自幽并，南踰交阯。\n过化存神，风行草靡。\n于戏，龙寿无已兮，百千斯年乘元气以终始兮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12550,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙德歌寿甘泉湛尊师 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"龙之骧，蹈厉奋扬，伸缩翕张。\n电裂碧空，奕奕其光。\n迅雷震之，震惊四方。\n蛇妖鼠怪，遁走伏藏。\n作雨瀼瀼，黍稷穰穰。\n南都民士，悦豫且康。\n于戏，龙寿无疆兮，百千斯年乘元气以翱翔兮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12551,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙德歌寿甘泉湛尊师 其四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"龙之归，冬烈秋凄。\n雨雪其霏，清霜疾威。\n寒气总来，何草不萎。\n罗浮之涯，阮湘之湄。\n以蛰以潜，以游以嬉。\n复见天心，味淡声希。\n于戏，龙寿无期兮，百千斯年乘元气以栖迟兮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12552,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]